        "title": "The two plans below show student accommodation in 2010 and now. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div class=\"block docx-text-block\" data-block-type=\"text\" data-block-id=\"74\" data-record-id=\"L4vZdNSDcoZwWxx9NFBlxyuzg4b\">\n<div class=\"text-block-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"text-block\">\n<div class=\"zone-container text-editor non-empty\" contenteditable=\"true\" data-zone-id=\"74\" data-zone-container=\"*\" data-slate-editor=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line\" dir=\"auto\" data-node=\"true\"><em><strong><span class=\" author-7514167488028868647\" data-string=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">The two plans below show student accommodation in 2010 and now. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></strong></em></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Student Accommodation Changes Over Time</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Student Accommodation Changes Over Time y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về sự thay đổi bố cục của một khu nh&agrave; ở sinh vi&ecirc;n trong khoảng thời gian từ năm 2010 đến hiện tại (Now).</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Student Accommodation Changes Over Time với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: bố cục của một t&ograve;a nh&agrave; k&yacute; t&uacute;c x&aacute; sinh vi&ecirc;n - năm 2010 v&agrave; hiện tại.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\">Khu k&yacute; t&uacute;c x&aacute; đ&atilde; được mở rộng đ&aacute;ng kể để phục vụ nhiều sinh vi&ecirc;n hơn, đặc biệt l&agrave; việc tăng <em>số lượng ph&ograve;ng ngủ (student bedrooms)</em> v&agrave; bổ sung ph&ograve;ng en-suite.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\">Thay đổi đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; nhất l&agrave; việc x&oacute;a bỏ <em>ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;ch (living room)</em> v&agrave; chuyển đổi <em>khu vườn ph&iacute;a sau (rear garden)</em> th&agrave;nh <em>b&atilde;i đỗ xe (car park)</em>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; <strong>về mặt địa l&yacute;</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Khu vực b&ecirc;n trong t&ograve;a nh&agrave; (Interior)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vw50dZaq3oF2ZIxm3TBlq500gRe\">(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi của ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;ch v&agrave; ph&ograve;ng ngủ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUA4dxEvgohR9ZxnhsblIGlIgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\">Ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;ch vốn chiếm <em>khu vực ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i (upper-left section)</em> đ&atilde; bị x&oacute;a bỏ ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUA4dxEvgohR9ZxnhsblIGlIgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\">Thay v&agrave;o đ&oacute;, 2 <em>ph&ograve;ng ngủ sinh vi&ecirc;n mới (additional student bedrooms)</em> được x&acirc;y dựng, n&acirc;ng tổng số ph&ograve;ng ngủ từ 3 l&ecirc;n 5 ph&ograve;ng.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUA4dxEvgohR9ZxnhsblIGlIgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\">Một ph&ograve;ng en-suite ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n mới được bổ sung ở <em>g&oacute;c dưới b&ecirc;n phải (lower-right area)</em>, <em>liền kề với (adjacent to)</em> một ph&ograve;ng ngủ sinh vi&ecirc;n.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MlX8dHCreoaAIXx2VHXlgT9ugNh\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả những thứ kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5hBdcWaxoptvfxYWxgl49IDgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p>Bếp, ph&ograve;ng tắm v&agrave; h&agrave;nh lang vẫn <em>giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; (remained in their original positions)</em> so với năm 2010.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;BODY</span><strong>&nbsp;2:</strong><strong> Khu vực b&ecirc;n ngo&agrave;i t&ograve;a nh&agrave; (Exterior)</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IkHudzeJ4oBsktxrxaeld0Dcgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi của khu vườn ph&iacute;a sau v&agrave; b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Khu vườn ph&iacute;a sau (garden at the rear of the accommodation)</em> đ&atilde; bị x&oacute;a bỏ ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n v&agrave; thay thế bằng <em>b&atilde;i đỗ xe (car park)</em>, đ&acirc;y l&agrave; thay đổi lớn nhất ở khu vực ngo&agrave;i trời.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\">Khu vườn b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i cũng tương tự bị loại bỏ.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NtzkdMhGco10OhxizWKlFrxEgSb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi của khu vườn ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QTPed1g1hoylwox5mXFltXnvgQf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p>Ngược lại, <em>khu vườn ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n (garden at the front of the property)</em> kh&ocirc;ng những được <em>giữ lại (retained)</em> m&agrave; c&ograve;n c&oacute; vẻ được <em>mở rộng hơn (expanded)</em>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3297,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The two floor plans illustrate how a student accommodation has been modified between 2010 and the present day.</p>",
            "question_id": 42234,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3298,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, the most notable change is that the accommodation has been significantly expanded to house more students, with the number of bedrooms increasing and communal living space being removed. Additionally, the outdoor area has been partially converted into a car park.</p>",
            "question_id": 42234,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3299,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the interior layout, the most significant alteration is the removal of the living room, which previously occupied the upper-left section of the building. In its place, two additional student bedrooms have been added, bringing the total number of bedrooms from three to five. Furthermore, a new en-suite room has been introduced in the lower-right area of the building, adjacent to one of the new student bedrooms. The kitchen, bathroom, and hallway, meanwhile, have all remained in their original positions.</p>",
            "question_id": 42234,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3300,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>As for the exterior, the garden that once surrounded the building on three sides in 2010 has been considerably reduced. Most notably, the garden at the rear of the accommodation has been entirely replaced by a car parking area. The small garden on the left side of the building has also been removed, though the garden at the front of the property has been retained and appears to have been expanded.</p>",
            "question_id": 42234,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
